### DevFest Hackathon 2026 Overview

Organized by **Google Developer Group (GDG) Central Florida**, DevFest Florida 2026 is designed as a collaborative, three-day sprint centered on building Generative AI-powered applications [source: 1]. Rather than a high-pressure, speed-based contest, the event emphasizes human-centric AI, ethical innovation, and community problem-solving [source: 1].

